来说，他已经是很了不起了。像是桑贞这样的女人，只在一边迷茫的看着她们，完全搞不清楚状况。“不对，是1，1个，你可以先学数字，1，2，3……”莫忆儿这次念得很慢，像是教小孩子一样教楚炑数数！楚炑也学的十分认真，并且很快，发音不准的时候，就一遍又一遍的念着，不会嫌麻烦。当他学会了十个数字的时候，脸上有了欣喜的表情：“这个数字真的很棒，你怎么想到的？”“我们那儿都这样数，别说数到10，就是更大的数字也有呢！什么百千万忆之类的，你需要学的还多着呢！”莫忆儿笑眯眯的说着，很是得意洋洋，现代人的知识博大精深，可不是一个原始人能够了解的。楚炑的目光变得深邃许多，这一刻，他竟然开始有些相信莫忆儿是神灵的人，否则，怎么会有这么渊博的知识？“莫忆儿，你们那里除了会数数，还有别的东西吗？”“当然了，比这里强多了。我们每天不止是吃肉，还有很多别的食物。我们不会每天只吃一顿饭，那样对身体不好，是分早上、中午、晚上三餐来吃。有的时候半夜饿了，还会吃宵夜！”莫忆儿想都不想就把吃饭的问题率先说了出来，这几天她可是一直在受罪之中，吃晚饭之前一直在饿肚子，偶尔胃也开始疼，长此下去，她真怕会得胃病。这个原始时期，生病就等于没了半条命，而且据她这几天的了解，这个二十多个人的小部落中根本就没什么医生。“吃那么多次？”楚炑开始震惊了，一天吃三四餐可是需要许多食物的，看来神灵们真的很富有。“是啊，基本上是吃三次，而且我们不会每次都使劲儿的往肚子里塞东西，这样会消化不良的，要少吃多餐明白吗？”楚炑摇摇头，神马养身之道对原始人来说就是对牛弹琴。“好了，不说了，说了你也不懂！”莫忆儿可没有好的耐心，索性结束了这个话题，以免一会儿自己不耐烦说出什么不好听的话来。楚炑也是个会看人脸色的原始人，见莫忆儿不耐烦，也没有再问，只是打定主意等莫忆儿心情好了，再和她学数字。莫忆儿不再说话，拿起骨针和桑贞一起缝制兽皮背心。兽皮很硬，莫忆儿力气又很小，所以每一针都缝的格外辛苦，一个兽皮背心还没缝到三分之一，桑贞已经把兽皮裙缝好了。“莫忆儿，给你穿上吧！”“这么快就好了，桑贞，太谢谢你了！”莫忆儿放下手中的小羊皮，拿起洁白的羊皮裙在身上比了比，白白的，毛绒绒的，真是好看。“快穿上试试，和不合身！”桑贞朴实的笑了。“啧啧啧，竟然用羊皮做兽皮裙，没想到你们坎内部落竟然这么穷！”皮肤黝黑的女人从洞外面走了进来，语调中满是不屑，她高傲的仰着头颅，宛若高人一等般。比起这个皮肤黝黑的黑女人，莫忆儿觉得高傲的楚炑都算得上是可爱了。桑贞抬头看了黑女人和她身上的熊皮裙一眼，没有理她。莫忆儿记得这个人是之前和楚炑站在一起的，难道她不是这个部落的人？不过，莫忆儿可不是这么好说话的，给她说些不好听的，她可不会装作没听见。“我就喜欢用羊皮，管你什么事儿？”“不管我什么事儿，我只是惊讶罢了！看你这么小的个子，是不是每天都吃不饱？神灵啊，早知道我就多带点食物来了！”黑女人夸张的说着，双手捂住胸口，装柔弱状。不过她的体格太过强装，堪比一个男人了，怎么看都不会觉得柔弱。“泰梨莎，你放心，我们坎内部落不会把你饿死的！”楚炑黑着一张脸，很是不高兴的对黑女人说，这时候幡戈也走了进来，脸上也明摆着不爽。“不，楚炑，我不是针对你，你别误会。我只是觉得坎内部落真的……嗯，太穷。你随我回海姆部落吧，我们有精美的食物，很多石器……绝对是你们坎内部落比不了的！”黑女人泰梨莎似乎没看到楚炑越来越黑的脸色，滔滔不绝的说着自己部落的优势，真是让人想一巴掌打死她。“泰梨莎，你收起心思吧，我们的首领是不会和你离开的，你最好早早死了这条心！”幡戈一直都是个笑容满面的阳光型男人，这一次，他也忍不住对人恶言相向，觉得这个女人太可恶了。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/8.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 8 The hateful black woman Chu Yi's brows furrowed even more, and he quickly cut off Mo Yi'er's lambskin, and then dug out a pile of small stones somewhere in the cave to compare with the stones Mo Yi'er found. Finding that Mo Yi'er had two more stones than himself, he took the two stones and said, \"You're lying!\" Mo Yi'er kept staring at his movements, and seeing him like this, he asked, \"You have lived for so many springs? Huh? Only 18, you are so mature!\" Looking at Chu Yi's face, he was horrified to find that this face was extremely beautiful, but the expression was too dull, especially the eyes, like a ferocious beast, which made people dare not look directly. But, is the owner of this face only 18 years old? Mo Yi'er couldn't believe it! \"18?\" Chu Yi seemed very interested in numbers. It was much easier and more accurate than using stones to calculate age. He also has to carefully collect the stones. Some people don't even know how many springs they have passed, that is, they don't know how old they are. Chu Yi and Ban Ge were very lucky. Ever since they were born, their parents had helped them pick a stone and bury it every spring. When they got older, he and Ban Ge would bury the stone together. Otherwise, he would never know how old he was. \"Well, eighteen, count like this, one, two...\" Mo Yi'er pulled Chu Yi's stones very proudly and taught him to count them one by one. In front of primitive people, she was simply a genius! Especially in front of Chu Yi, a man who seemed very arrogant, Mo Yi'er felt very accomplished. Damn it, you are illiterate! \"Once passed, measured?\" Mo Yi'er counted too fast. Chu Yi's pronunciation was a bit irregular this time, but for primitive people, he was already amazing. Women like Sang Zhen just looked at them confusedly, completely confused about the situation. \"No, it's 1, 1. You can learn the numbers first, 1, 2, 3...\" Mo Yi'er read slowly this time, teaching Chu Yi to count like a child! Chu Yi also learned it very seriously and very quickly. When his pronunciation was not correct, he would recite it over and over again without any trouble. When he learned ten numbers, there was an expression of joy on his face: \"This number is really great. How did you come up with it?\" \"We all count like this there, not to mention counting to 10, even bigger numbers! You still have a lot to learn about millions and millions of memories!\" Mo Yi'er said with a smile, very proudly. The knowledge of modern people is profound and profound, which is not something that a primitive person can understand. Chu Yi's eyes became much deeper. At this moment, he actually began to believe that Mo Yi'er was a god. Otherwise, how could he have such profound knowledge? \"Mo Yi'er, besides counting, do you have anything else there?\" \"Of course, it's much better than here. We eat not only meat every day, but also a lot of other foods. We don't just eat one meal a day, which is not good for the body. We have three meals in the morning, noon, and evening. Come and eat. Sometimes when you are hungry in the middle of the night, you will have a midnight snack!\" Mo Yier took the lead in talking about the problem of eating. She has been suffering these days. She has been hungry before dinner, and occasionally her stomach starts to hurt. If this continues, she is really afraid that she will get a stomach disease. In this primitive period, getting sick was equivalent to losing half of your life, and according to what she learned in the past few days, there were no doctors at all in this small tribe of more than 20 people. \"Eating so many times?\" Chu Yi began to be shocked. Eating three or four meals a day requires a lot of food. It seems that the gods are really rich. \"Yes, we basically eat three times, and we don't stuff things into our stomachs every time. This will cause indigestion. Do you understand that we need to eat less and more meals?\" Chu Yi shook his head. The magic way to maintain health for primitive people is to play the piano with others. \"Okay, let's stop talking. You won't understand even if you do!\" Mo Yi'er didn't have good patience, so she simply ended the topic to avoid being impatient and saying something unpleasant later. Chu Yi was also a primitive person who could read people's faces. Seeing that Mo Yi'er was impatient, he didn't ask any more questions. He just made up his mind to wait until Mo Yi'er was in a better mood before learning numbers from her. Mo Yi'er stopped talking and picked up the bone needle to sew the animal skin vest with Sang Zhen. The animal skin was very hard, and Mo Yi'er was very weak, so every stitch was very hard to sew. Before a third of the animal skin vest was sewn, Sang Zhen had already sewn the animal skin skirt. \"Mo Yi'er, let's put it on for you!\" \"It'll be ready so soon, Sang Zhen, thank you so much!\" Mo Yi'er put down the lambskin in her hand, picked up the white sheepskin skirt and compared it with her body. It was white, plush, and really beautiful. \"Hurry up and try it on to see if it fits you!\" Sang Zhen smiled simply. \"Tsk, tsk, tsk, sheepskin is used to make an animal skin skirt. I didn't expect that your Kannei tribe is so poor!\" A dark-skinned woman walked in from outside the cave, her tone full of disdain, and she raised her head proudly, as if she was superior to others. Compared to this dark-skinned black woman, Mo Yi'er felt that the proud Chu Yi was cute. Sang Zhen looked up at the black woman and the bearskin skirt she was wearing, and ignored her. Mo Yi'er remembered that this person was standing with Chu Yi before. Isn't she from this tribe? However, Mo Yi'er is not that easy to talk to. If you say something unpleasant to her, she will not pretend not to hear it. \"I just like to use sheepskin, what does it matter to you?\" \"It doesn't matter to me, I'm just surprised! You are so small, don't you have enough to eat every day? God, if you had known, I would have brought more food!\" The black woman said exaggeratedly, covering her chest with both hands, pretending to be weak. However, her physique is too strong, comparable to that of a man, and she never feels weak no matter how you look at her. \"Terissa, don't worry, our Kanai tribe will not starve you.", "title_en": "Chapter 8"}